Synthetic scorer self-test case: typeonly-star-shared-mid

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S2b, S7

Scenario
src/orders/api.ts re-exports the orders repository's updateOrderStatus as a type-only star and a value star of the same file src/orders/mid.ts (`export * from "./repository"`); the payments service imports `updateOrderStatus` from it and calls it.

Expected
The type-only path visits src/orders/mid.ts first; the tracer memoises per file and symbol instead of refusing a second visit, so the value path through the same file still yields a runtime CRITICAL_LAUNDERED (review finding 6).

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.

Deliberately not asserted
- tsc_ok: tsc rejects the duplicate star re-export of one module; Bun accepts it.
